<title>HONG KONG: Jardine Matheson names new directors.</title>
<headline>Jardine Matheson names new directors.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd said on Thursday James Watkins and Norman Lyle will join its board as executive directors.</p>
<p>They will replace Greg Terry and Christopher Cowan, who will both retire this year, a statement said.</p>
<p>Watkins will take up his appointment in June and Lyle in July, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
